  unitName: Triumphant Blaze Valen
  unitId: 11037
  unitNumber: 1556
  description: The second commander of the Imperial Guard who devoted his life to
    the empire in order to atone for the disloyalty he once showed towards his closest
    friend. Had Valen supported his friend's plans to destroy the demon at their
    doorstep, they might have been able to persuade the emperor to put it into action.
    Together, they would have defeated the demon in a magnificent battle that would
    have paved the way to the most powerful era of the Imperial Guard.
  summonDesc: Everyone has their own talents, but mine are nothing exceptional...<br>He
    would be more suited to be commander.
  fusionDesc: You have my thanks for this power. I shall use it for my troops...<br>No,
    I shall use it to support my friend.
  evoDesc: It is important to place your faith in others. To think relying on those
    who have your back could lead to this.
  element: 1
  rarity: 7
